[en.FOCUS_C18_001_HEALTH_CARE]
Health Care

[en.FOCUS_C18_001_HEALTH_CARE_desc]
Disease remains a significant threat to the poor Kirins, and data shows that each epidemic will lead to an increase in the Nirik Rate. Therefore, we need to strengthen health care to reduce the impact of diseases on the Kirins.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_001_HEALTH_CARE]
医疗保障

[zh.FOCUS_C18_001_HEALTH_CARE_desc]
疾病依然是困扰着贫困麒麟的重要威胁，数据显示每次疫情都会导致逆麟率升高，所以我们需要加强医疗保障，以减少疾病对麒麟们的影响。

